{"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "animate", "ucas": "animate hillis scan n 4 fps 2 seconds 1", "structured": false, "result": {"text": "prefix sum of 4 u32 values (1..n), cost model gt1030\n  values: 1 2 3 4\n  per element: load 8, add 1, barrier 20, divergence 8\n    algorithm      levels     time     work\n    Hillis-Steele       2       86      173   <- animated\n    Blelloch            5      220      182\n    sequential          3       59       59\n  Hillis-Steele levels:\n    d=1        3 ops  lane   25 +diverge +barrier  t = 0..53\n    d=2        2 ops  lane   25 +diverge  t = 53..86\n  result: 1 3 6 10\n  animation: 420x202, 5 frames at 2 fps (1.0 s, then the result for 1.5 s), 1 s = 86.0 cost units; 5022 bytes\n  (files: none) scan.gif, 5022 bytes, not written\n"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "prefix sum of 4 u32 values (1..n), cost model gt1030\n  values: 1 2 3 4\n  per element: load 8, add 1, barrier 20, divergence 8\n    algorithm      levels     time     work\n    Hillis-Steele       2       86      173   <- animated\n    Blelloch            5      220      182\n    sequential          3       59       59\n  Hillis-Steele levels:\n    d=1        3 ops  lane   25 +diverge +barrier  t = 0..53\n    d=2        2 ops  lane   25 +diverge  t = 53..86\n  result: 1 3 6 10\n  animation: 420x202, 5 frames at 2 fps (1.0 s, then the result for 1.5 s), 1 s = 86.0 cost units; 5022 bytes\n  (files: none) scan.gif, 5022 bytes, not written\n"}
